    "Expected: (1) A PvE party in Group Loot or Need Before Greed killing Stonard Shaman gets gold (loot window opens) with 0 copies of 1303729 in loot and 0 SMSG_LOOT_ROLL (674) auto-pass packets on either member. (2) In a mixed Group Loot party (one High-Risk, one PvE), 1303729 drops, the High-Risk member receives SMSG_LOOT_START_ROLL (673) and immediately wins it by voting Need, while the PvE member receives 0 SMSG_LOOT_ROLL (674) packets. (3) A solo War Mode player (1004119 without 9931032) still receives and loots 1303729.",
    "Nothing is probabilistic: Stonard Shaman drops 1303729 at 100% and every player has capped hit/expertise against 1-health stationary fixtures."
  ],
